// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 5
window.T5_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"advertise – berry","cards":[{"w":"advertise","p":"v.","d":"to describe or draw attention to a product or service in public media to promote sales","c":"打廣告；宣傳；登廣告","s":"To reach more young customers, the electronic company decided to advertise its new smartphone in popular magazines.","t":"為了接觸更多年輕客戶，這家電子公司決定在暢銷雜誌上為其新款智慧型手機打廣告宣傳。"},{"w":"advertiser","p":"n.","d":"a person or company that pays for advertisements to promote products","c":"廣告商；廣告主（可數）","s":"Television networks often adjust their broadcasting schedules to satisfy the demands of commercial advertisers.","t":"電視聯播網經常調整其播出節目表，以滿足商業廣告主的要求。"},{"w":"advertising","p":"n.","d":"the activity or profession of producing advertisements for products (uncountable)","c":"廣告業；廣告宣傳活動（不可數）","s":"The cosmetics brand launched an extensive global advertising campaign featuring several top Hollywood fashion models.","t":"該化妝品品牌發起了一場大型全球廣告宣傳活動，並邀請了幾位好萊塢頂尖時尚名模代言。"},{"w":"advertisement","p":"n.","d":"a public notice or announcement promoting a product, event, or job vacancy","c":"廣告；啟事（可數，簡稱 ad）","s":"While reading the morning newspaper, Patrick saw an advertisement for an interesting marketing job at an international trading company.","t":"在閱讀早報時，派翠克看見了一則跨國貿易公司有趣行銷職缺的徵才廣告。"},{"w":"commercial","p":"n.","d":"a paid television or radio advertisement","c":"（電視或廣播）商業廣告（可數）","s":"Viewers often walk to the kitchen to grab a snack during the long commercial break of the Super Bowl broadcast.","t":"觀眾通常在超級盃轉播漫長的廣告時間走到廚房拿點心吃。"},{"w":"afford","p":"v.","d":"to have enough money, time, or resources to be able to buy or do something","c":"負擔得起；買得起；抽得出（時間）","s":"After saving money diligently for five years, the young couple could finally afford to buy their first apartment in the city.","t":"在勤奮存錢五年之後，這對年輕夫婦終於能夠負擔得起在市區買下他們的第一套公寓。"},{"w":"affordable","p":"adj.","d":"reasonably priced and inexpensive enough for ordinary people to buy","c":"負擔得起的；價格合理的","s":"The city government plans to build hundreds of affordable housing units for low-income families and university graduates.","t":"市政府計畫為低收入家庭與大學畢業生興建數百戶負擔得起的／經濟實惠的社會住宅。"},{"w":"amaze","p":"v.","d":"to surprise someone greatly; to fill with wonder","c":"使大為驚奇；使驚嘆（動詞）","s":"The clever magician amazed the cheering crowd by making a massive white horse disappear right before their eyes.","t":"那個聰明的魔術師在觀眾眼前讓一匹巨大的白馬憑空消失，使所有人大為驚嘆。"},{"w":"amazed","p":"adj.","d":"feeling or showing great surprise or wonder","c":"感到大為驚奇的；驚嘆的","s":"Foreign tourists were utterly amazed at the breathtaking natural beauty of the rocky sea cliffs along the coast.","t":"外國遊客對沿海岩石海崖令人屏息的自然美景感到徹底驚嘆不已。"},{"w":"amazing","p":"adj.","d":"causing great surprise or wonder; astonishingly good","c":"令人驚奇的；令人讚嘆的；極好的","s":"The high school basketball team did an amazing job by winning ten consecutive matches against tough rivals.","t":"這支高中籃球隊表現得極好，連續擊敗強勁對手贏得了十場比賽。"},{"w":"amazement","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of great surprise or wonder (uncountable)","c":"驚奇；驚詫；讚嘆（不可數名詞）","s":"Oliver looked up at the towering Eiffel Tower in Paris with a look of pure amazement on his face.","t":"奧利佛臉上帶著純粹驚奇讚嘆的神情仰望著巴黎高聳的艾菲爾鐵塔。"},{"w":"ambassador","p":"n.","d":"an accredited diplomat sent by a country as its official representative","c":"大使；使節；形象代表（可數）","s":"The veteran diplomat was appointed by the president to serve as the new ambassador to France.","t":"這位資深外交官被總統任命為派駐法國的新任大使。"},{"w":"embassy","p":"n.","d":"the official residence or offices of an ambassador in a foreign country","c":"大使館（可數名詞）","s":"When Jason accidentally lost his passport while backpacking in Tokyo, he immediately rushed to the national embassy for assistance.","t":"當傑森在東京背包客旅行不慎弄丟護照時，他立刻趕往本國大使館尋求協助。"},{"w":"awake","p":"v.","d":"to stop sleeping or cause someone to stop sleeping","c":"醒來；喚起；使意識到（動詞）","s":"Charlie suddenly awoke to a deafening thunderclap that rattled the bedroom windows during the night.","t":"查理在夜間被震得臥室窗戶發響的震耳雷聲猛然吵醒。"},{"w":"awake","p":"adj.","d":"not asleep; conscious and alert","c":"清醒的；沒睡著的","s":"Drinking a strong cup of black coffee before studying helped the tired student stay awake late into the night.","t":"溫書前喝一杯濃黑咖啡幫助疲憊的學生在深夜保持清醒。"},{"w":"awaken","p":"v.","d":"to wake someone up; to arouse feelings or memories","c":"喚醒；激發；使覺醒（動詞）","s":"Walking through the quiet old neighborhood after twenty years awakened fond childhood memories in Grandfather's heart.","t":"相隔二十年後走過安靜的老社區，在祖父心中喚醒了美好的童年回憶。"},{"w":"aware","p":"adj.","d":"having knowledge or perception of a situation or fact","c":"意識到的；知道的；注意到的","s":"I was not aware of the strict new parking regulations downtown until a traffic police officer warned me.","t":"直到一名交警警告我，我才意識到／知道市中心嚴格的停車新規定。"},{"w":"awareness","p":"n.","d":"knowledge or perception of a situation, issue, or fact (uncountable)","c":"意識；體認；認識（不可數名詞）","s":"The charity organization organized an annual marathon in the park to raise public awareness about ocean plastic pollution.","t":"該慈善組織在公園舉辦了年度馬拉松，以提升大眾對海洋塑膠污染的公眾意識。"},{"w":"beetle","p":"n.","d":"an insect of an order distinguished by forewings modified into hard wing cases","c":"甲蟲（可數名詞）","s":"While exploring the damp forest floor, the biology students discovered a rare species of horned beetle under a fallen log.","t":"在探索潮濕的森林地面時，生物系的學生在倒木下發現了一種罕見的有角甲蟲品種。"},{"w":"berry","p":"n.","d":"a small round juicy fruit without a stone or pit","c":"漿果；莓果（可數名詞）","s":"Every summer, our family visits a local farm in the countryside to pick sweet and juicy wild berries together.","t":"每年夏天，我們全家都會去鄉村的當地農場一起採摘香甜多汁的野生莓果。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"blouse – float","cards":[{"w":"blouse","p":"n.","d":"a woman's upper garment resembling a shirt","c":"女裝襯衫；女式短衫（可數）","s":"Jenny wore an elegant white silk blouse to the corporate cocktail party last night.","t":"珍妮昨晚穿著一件優雅的白色絲質女裝襯衫去參加企業酒會。"},{"w":"clown","p":"n.","d":"a comic performer who wears outlandish costume and makeup to entertain people","c":"小丑；丑角（可數名詞）","s":"Kyle hired a funny circus clown to twist colorful balloon animals for the children at the birthday party.","t":"凱爾在生日派對上聘請了一位滑稽的馬戲團小丑為孩子們折出五彩氣球動物。"},{"w":"clown around","p":"v.phr.","d":"to behave in a silly or playful way instead of being serious","c":"胡鬧；嬉鬧；扮小丑作怪","s":"The strict gym teacher blew his whistle and ordered the energetic boys to stop clowning around and line up immediately.","t":"嚴格的體育老師吹響哨子，命令精力充沛的男孩們停止胡鬧嬉戲並立刻排好隊。"},{"w":"cock","p":"n.","d":"a male domestic bird; a rooster","c":"公雞（可數名詞）","s":"Early every morning, this noisy farm cock crows loudly, reminding the whole village that a brand new day has begun.","t":"每天清晨，這隻吵鬧的農場公雞都會大聲啼叫，提醒整個村莊嶄新的一天已經開始。"},{"w":"cocky","p":"adj.","d":"boldly or impudently self-confident; arrogant","c":"自高自大的；狂妄自負的","s":"Nobody in the debate club liked his cocky attitude because he always boasted about his past debate victories.","t":"辯論社裡沒有人喜歡他那狂妄自大的態度，因為他總是誇耀自己過去的辯論勝利。"},{"w":"conclusion","p":"n.","d":"the end or finish of an event; a decision reached by reasoning","c":"結論；結局；結束（可數/不可數）","s":"After discussing the financial problem for three hours, the committee members finally reached a sensible conclusion on the new budget.","t":"在探討財務問題三個小時後，委員會成員終於就新預算達成了一個明智的結論。"},{"w":"conclude","p":"v.","d":"to bring or come to an end; to arrive at an opinion by reasoning","c":"結束；斷定；締結（動詞）","s":"The university professor concluded his inspiring ninety-minute lecture with a famous quote from Albert Einstein.","t":"大學教授以愛因斯坦的一句名言結束了他那場長達九十分鐘的精彩講座。"},{"w":"decrease","p":"v.","d":"to become smaller or fewer in size, amount, intensity, or degree","c":"減少；減小；降低（動詞，/dɪˈkriːs/）","s":"To save enough money for their summer vacation, the family agreed to decrease their monthly spending on dining out.","t":"為了存足暑期度假的錢，全家人同意減少他們每個月外出用餐的開銷。"},{"w":"decrease","p":"n.","d":"an instance or amount of becoming smaller or fewer","c":"減少；下降（可數/不可數，/ˈdiː.kriːs/）","s":"Due to fierce competition from rival online stores, the retail bookstore experienced a sharp decrease in textbook sales this semester.","t":"由於來自競爭網路商店的激烈競爭，實體書店這學期經歷了教科書銷售量的急劇下滑／減少。"},{"w":"drown","p":"v.","d":"to die through submersion in and inhalation of water; to overwhelm with sound","c":"淹死；溺斃；（聲音）淹沒","s":"Tragically, three brave fishermen drowned when their small wooden fishing boat sank during the violent midnight hurricane.","t":"令人痛心的是，三名勇敢的漁民在其小型木製漁船於午夜猛烈颶風中沉沒時不幸溺斃。"},{"w":"efficient","p":"adj.","d":"achieving maximum productivity with minimum wasted effort or expense","c":"效率高的；有能力的","s":"Jessica is an extremely efficient administrative secretary who manages complex office filing systems without wasting time or energy.","t":"潔西卡是一位極有效率的行政秘書，處理複雜的辦公室歸檔系統從不浪費時間或精力。"},{"w":"efficiency","p":"n.","d":"the state or quality of being efficient (uncountable)","c":"效率；效能（不可數名詞）","s":"Introducing automated robotic sorting machines helped the busy delivery warehouse improve its package handling efficiency by forty percent.","t":"引進自動化機器人分揀設備幫助繁忙的快遞倉庫將其包裹處理效率提升了百分之四十。"},{"w":"float","p":"v.","d":"to rest or move on or near the surface of a liquid without sinking","c":"漂浮；浮動；使漂流（動詞）","s":"Because the mineral-rich water of the Dead Sea is extremely salty, swimmers can float on the surface very easily without sinking.","t":"因為死海富含礦物質的水極鹹，泳客可以非常輕鬆地漂浮在水面上而不會沉下去。"},{"w":"float","p":"n.","d":"an elaborately decorated platform on a truck in a parade; a buoyant device","c":"（遊行中的）花車；漂浮物；浮標（可數）","s":"During the annual spring floral festival, cheerful dancers rode on a magnificent float covered with fresh blooming roses.","t":"在一年一度的春季花卉節期間，興高采烈的舞者們乘坐在一輛覆蓋著新鮮盛開玫瑰的壯麗花車上。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"fur – location","cards":[{"w":"fur","p":"n.","d":"the short, fine, soft hair covering the skin of animals (uncountable/countable)","c":"毛皮；軟毛（不可數/可數）","s":"I would never buy an expensive genuine fur coat because killing innocent wild animals for luxury fashion is extremely cruel.","t":"我絕不會購買昂貴的真毛皮大衣，因為為了奢華時尚而殺害無辜的野生動物是極其殘忍的。"},{"w":"hunger","p":"n.","d":"a severe lack of food; the feeling or state of wanting to eat (uncountable)","c":"飢餓；飢荒；渴望（不可數）","s":"The inspiring university student had an insatiable hunger for scientific knowledge and read hundreds of physics books.","t":"那位積極進取的大學生對科學知識有著永不滿足的渴望，閱讀了數百本物理書籍。"},{"w":"hut","p":"n.","d":"a small, simple, single-story house or shelter","c":"小屋；棚屋；茅舍（可數名詞）","s":"During the unexpected blizzard on the mountain peak, the exhausted climbers found safety inside a sturdy rescue hut.","t":"在高山頂遭遇突如其來的暴風雪時，筋疲力盡的登山者在一座堅固的救援避難小屋內找到了安全庇護。"},{"w":"imagination","p":"n.","d":"the faculty or action of forming new ideas, images, or concepts not present to the senses","c":"想像力；想像（可數/不可數）","s":"Children naturally possess a rich and playful imagination that allows them to invent fascinating games out of ordinary cardboard boxes.","t":"孩童天生具備豐富且童趣的想像力，使他們能用普通的紙箱創造出迷人的遊戲。"},{"w":"imagine","p":"v.","d":"to form a mental image or concept of; to suppose or assume","c":"想像；料想；猜想（動詞）","s":"I can hardly imagine living in a remote polar station where winter temperatures frequently drop below minus forty degrees Celsius.","t":"我幾乎難以想像生活在冬季氣溫常降至攝氏零下四十度以下的偏遠極地科考站。"},{"w":"imaginative","p":"adj.","d":"having or showing creativity or inventiveness","c":"富有想像力的；創新的","s":"The art teacher gave first prize to the imaginative student whose painting featured fantastical flying creatures and glowing crystal cities.","t":"美術老師將第一名頒給了那位富有想像力的學生，其畫作以奇幻的飛行生物和發光水晶城市為特色。"},{"w":"inn","p":"n.","d":"a small hotel or pub, typically one in the country providing accommodation and food","c":"小旅館；鄉間客棧；旅店（可數）","s":"After driving along the quiet coastal highway for six hours, the tired travelers spent a restful night at a charming country inn.","t":"沿著幽靜的沿海公路開車六小時後，疲憊的旅客在一家迷人的鄉村小客棧／旅館度過了寧靜的一晚。"},{"w":"kit","p":"n.","d":"a set of articles or equipment needed for a specific purpose","c":"成套工具；配套用具；工具箱（可數）","s":"Winnie bought a convenient travel makeup kit at the duty-free shop and carries it with her on all overseas business trips.","t":"溫妮在免稅店買了一套便攜的旅行化妝用具組／包，每次出國出差都隨身攜帶。"},{"w":"leather","p":"n.","d":"material made from the skin of an animal by tanning or a similar process (uncountable)","c":"皮革；皮料（不可數名詞）","s":"Vincent proudly wore his stylish new brown leather jacket when he arrived at the outdoor barbecue party on his motorcycle.","t":"文森騎著重型機車抵達戶外烤肉派對時，驕傲地穿著他時髦的全新棕色皮夾克。"},{"w":"locate","p":"v.","d":"to discover the exact place or position of; to establish in a particular place","c":"找出位置；坐落於；設於（動詞）","s":"The experienced IT engineer spent nearly two hours examining the computer server system to locate the technical bug.","t":"經驗豐富的資訊工程師花了將近兩個小時檢查伺服器系統，以找出技術漏洞所在。"},{"w":"location","p":"n.","d":"a particular place or position","c":"地點；位置；所在地（可數名詞）","s":"The seaside resort hotel is situated in an ideal location with sandy beaches and crystal clear ocean waters within easy walking distance.","t":"該海濱渡假酒店坐落於理想的地點，沙灘與清澈碧藍的海水都在輕鬆步行的距離之內。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"mayor – sticky","cards":[{"w":"mayor","p":"n.","d":"the elected head of a city, town, or other municipality","c":"市長；鎮長（可數名詞）","s":"The deputy mayor held an urgent press conference at the municipal hall to discuss emergency flood relief measures.","t":"副市長在市政廳舉行了緊急記者會，以商討緊急防洪救災措施。"},{"w":"nap","p":"n.","d":"a short sleep, especially during the day","c":"小睡；打盹；午睡（可數名詞）","s":"Sharon's energetic baby usually takes a quiet one-hour nap in her cozy crib every afternoon.","t":"雪倫精力充沛的寶寶通常每天下午在她舒適的小嬰兒床裡安靜小睡一小時。"},{"w":"nap","p":"v.","d":"to sleep lightly or briefly, especially during the day","c":"打盹；小睡（動詞）","s":"After eating a heavy lunch at the restaurant, Grandfather peacefully napped on the living room sofa for thirty minutes.","t":"在餐廳吃了一頓豐盛的午餐後，祖父在客廳沙發上平靜地小睡／打盹了三十分鐘。"},{"w":"nickname","p":"n.","d":"a familiar or humorous name given to a person instead of or as well as the real name","c":"綽號；暱稱（可數名詞）","s":"Because Diane was such an astonishingly fast runner on the track team, her classmates gave her the nickname 'Speedy.'","t":"因為黛安在田徑隊跑得驚人地快，她的同班同學給了她一個綽號「飛毛腿」。"},{"w":"nickname","p":"v.","d":"to give a nickname to someone","c":"給…取綽號；給…取暱稱（動詞）","s":"Due to his towering height and powerful basketball skills, the coach nicknamed young Jason after Shaquille O'Neal.","t":"由於高聳的身高與強大的籃球技術，教練以俠客·歐尼爾之名給年輕的傑森取了綽號。"},{"w":"ongoing","p":"adj.","d":"continuing; still in progress","c":"進行中的；持續存在的","s":"The police confirmed that the criminal investigation into the downtown art gallery theft is ongoing and new suspects are being questioned.","t":"警方證實，對市中心美術館竊案的刑事調查仍在進行中，目前正在審問新的嫌疑犯。"},{"w":"receipt","p":"n.","d":"a written acknowledgment of having received a specified amount of money; the action of receiving","c":"收據；發票；收到（可數/不可數）","s":"Please remember to hand each customer a printed sales receipt whenever they complete a credit card payment at the cash register.","t":"每當顧客在收銀機完成信用卡付款時，請記得親手交給每位顧客一張列印的銷售收據。"},{"w":"replace","p":"v.","d":"to take the place of; to provide a substitute for","c":"取代；替換；更換（動詞）","s":"Our administrative office urgently needs to purchase modern ergonomic chairs to replace these broken and uncomfortable old wooden ones.","t":"我們的行政辦公室急需採購現代人體工學椅，以替換／取代這些破損且不舒服的舊木椅。"},{"w":"replacement","p":"n.","d":"the action or process of replacing someone or something; a person or thing that takes the place of another","c":"替代品；接替者；更換（可數/不可數）","s":"Because my smartphone screen cracked completely when I dropped it, the insurance company sent me a brand new replacement within twenty-four hours.","t":"因為我的智慧型手機摔在地上螢幕徹底摔裂，保險公司在二十四小時內寄給了我一個全新的替代機／替代品。"},{"w":"splash","p":"v.","d":"to cause liquid to strike or fall on something in scattered drops","c":"濺濕；潑水；飛濺（動詞）","s":"On hot summer afternoons, cheerful children had tremendous fun splashing around in the shallow outdoor swimming pool.","t":"在炎熱的夏日下午，活潑的孩子們在室外淺水泳池裡潑水嬉戲，玩得不亦樂乎。"},{"w":"splash","p":"n.","d":"a sound made by something striking or falling into liquid; an ostentatious display","c":"濺潑聲；斑點；引人注目的展示（可數）","s":"Her dazzling designer outfit and charismatic confidence at the charity gala definitely made a huge splash in all fashion magazines.","t":"她在慈善晚會上耀眼的名牌服飾與充滿魅力的自信，絕對在所有時尚雜誌上引起了巨大轟動／一鳴驚人。"},{"w":"sticky","p":"adj.","d":"tending or designed to stick to things; humid and hot; difficult or awkward","c":"黏的；濕熱難耐的；棘手的","s":"Because the fresh honey pancakes were coated with sweet maple syrup, the little toddler's fingers were completely sticky after breakfast.","t":"因為新鮮的蜂蜜鬆餅淋滿了甜楓糖漿，小幼童吃完早餐後手指完全黏答答的。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"tap – traveler","cards":[{"w":"tap","p":"v.","d":"to strike lightly with a quick, gentle blow","c":"輕拍；輕敲；輕叩（動詞）","s":"While listening to the lively jazz music, the excited children began to tap their feet happily on the wooden floor.","t":"在聆聽輕快的爵士樂時，興奮的孩子們開始在木地板上開心地隨著節拍踏腳。"},{"w":"tap","p":"n.","d":"a gentle strike; a device by which liquid or gas from a pipe or container is controlled","c":"輕拍（聲）；水龍頭；旋塞（可數名詞）","s":"Henry felt a gentle tap on his left shoulder, so he turned around curiously to see who it was.","t":"亨利感到左肩上有人輕輕拍了一下，於是好奇地轉過身去看是誰。"},{"w":"faucet","p":"n.","d":"a device by which a flow of liquid or gas from a pipe or container can be controlled","c":"水龍頭（可數名詞）","s":"The irritating sound of water dripping from the leaky bathroom faucet kept me awake all night.","t":"浴室裡漏水水龍頭滴滴答答惱人的滴水聲讓我整夜無法入睡。"},{"w":"toss","p":"v.","d":"to throw something lightly or casually; to shake or turn over","c":"隨手扔；拋擲；拌（沙拉）（動詞）","s":"Before roasting the fresh vegetables in the oven, please toss them gently with extra virgin olive oil and salt.","t":"在把新鮮蔬菜放進烤箱烘烤之前，請用特級初榨橄欖油和鹽巴將它們輕輕拌勻。"},{"w":"toss","p":"n.","d":"a light, casual throw","c":"拋；擲；投（可數名詞）","s":"The national rugby team captain won the coin toss and elected to defend the southern goal first.","t":"國家橄欖球隊隊長在擲硬幣中獲勝，並選擇先防守南側球門。"},{"w":"tow","p":"v.","d":"to pull a vehicle or boat along behind another vehicle using a rope or chain","c":"拖曳；拖拉；拖吊（車輛）（動詞）","s":"If you park your automobile illegally in front of the hospital emergency exit, it will be promptly towed away by traffic police.","t":"如果你把汽車違規停在醫院急診出口前，它很快就會被交通警察拖吊走。"},{"w":"tow","p":"n.","d":"an act of towing; a tow truck service","c":"拖吊；牽引（可數/不可數名詞）","s":"When his engine suddenly overheated on the highway, David called the auto club to ask for an emergency tow.","t":"當汽車引擎在公路上突然過熱時，大衛打電話給汽車俱樂部請求緊急拖吊服務。"},{"w":"transport","p":"v.","d":"to take or carry people or goods from one place to another by vehicle, aircraft, or ship","c":"運送；運輸；輸送（動詞，/trænˈspɔːt/）","s":"The international shipping logistics company uses huge container cargo vessels to transport goods across the Pacific Ocean.","t":"該跨國海運物流公司使用大型貨櫃貨輪橫跨太平洋運送貨物。"},{"w":"transport","p":"n.","d":"a system or means of conveying people or goods from place to place (uncountable)","c":"交通運輸；交通工具；輸送（不可數，/ˈtræn.spɔːt/）","s":"Environmental scientists warmly encourage city residents to use eco-friendly public transport such as clean electric buses and subway trains.","t":"環境科學家熱情鼓勵市民使用環保大眾運輸工具，例如清潔電動公車與地鐵。"},{"w":"transportation","p":"n.","d":"the action of transporting someone or something or the system of conveyances","c":"交通運輸工具；運輸系統（不可數）","s":"Developing efficient public transportation infrastructure is essential for reducing harmful carbon emissions and traffic congestion in metropolitan areas.","t":"發展高效能的大眾交通運輸基礎設施，對於減少大都會地區有害碳排放與交通壅塞至關重要。"},{"w":"traveler","p":"n.","d":"a person who is traveling or who often travels","c":"旅客；旅行者（可數名詞）","s":"The welcoming historic country inn offered warm beds and hearty meals to weary travelers caught in the snowstorm.","t":"那家熱情好客的歷史悠久鄉村客棧，為暴風雪中疲憊的行路人／旅客提供了溫暖的床鋪與豐盛的餐點。"}]}];
